# Intentionally EMPTY of rules.
#
# All redirects (the /proxy/* same-origin rewrites AND the SPA fallback) live in
# netlify.toml only. Keeping a catch-all "/*  /index.html  200" here is risky:
# Netlify merges rules from netlify.toml and from _redirects in the publish
# directory, and a catch-all in this file can match /proxy/* BEFORE the proxy
# rewrites, returning the HTML app shell instead of JSON -> "Unexpected token '<'".
# Do not add redirect rules here; edit netlify.toml (proxy rules first, SPA last).
